.agents/

# `tina4 books` extracts to ./tina4-book/ at the cwd. Ignore stray root pulls.
/tina4-book/

# The documentation source lands at documentation/tina4-book/ — either a `tina4 books`
# pull or a symlink to a local clone of tina4stack/tina4-book (see CLAUDE.md →
# Documentation source). Untracked either way: a committed symlink dangles in fresh
# clones, and a committed pull duplicates an upstream repo. documentation/.gitkeep
# preserves the parent dir.
/documentation/tina4-book
/documentation/tina4-book/*
